│   │   └── 取值：IEEE, ACM, ISI WoS, Science Direct, Springer, Scopus, Google Scholar
│   ├── [leaf-re-tertiary-study-2014-orig-search-method] 搜索方式
│   │   └── 取值：automated / manual / snowballing
